-- transform-move apply: shift the scratch BOX away from its creation position.
-- Ported from increment_fixture/cases/transform_apply.mac (navigate by name, not
-- by refno — see db8000_zone_members_probe.mac head note).
--
-- The restore value is knowable offline only because db8000_scratch_create.mac
-- established it: a fresh BOX sits at E 0 N 0 U 0 relative to its owner.
--
-- restore partner: db8000_scratch_move_restore.mac.

ALPHA LOG "D:/work/plant-code/old/gen-model/scripts/e3d/db8000_scratch_move_apply.log" OVER
$P CODEX-DB8000-SCRATCH-MOVE-APPLY-ALIVE
/CODEX_DB8000_SCRATCH
Q CE
Q REF
Q NAME
POS E 1000 N 1000 U 1000
Q CE
Q POS
Q REF
Q NAME
SAVEWORK 'CODEX db8000 move scratch BOX to E1000 N1000 U1000'
$P CODEX-DB8000-SCRATCH-MOVE-APPLY-DONE
ALPHA LOG END
